* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_bndcst (reference/crafted.toml, 14 Nov 2026): bounds on the costs
* of a region by cost type (REG_BNDCST, REG_CUMCST), the equation EQ_BNDCST and the variable
* VAR_CUMCST (eqbndcst.mod L42-77 and L81-213, bnd_cum.mod L44-48).
* Added to TIMES_Demo demo12 (etsap-TIMES/TIMES_Demo @ 962db86, CC BY 4.0). demo12 has no taxes,
* subsidies or decommissioning costs, so the case adds them first. The periods of demo12:
* 2005 (2005-2007), 2010 (2008-2012), 2015 (2013-2017), 2020 (2018-2025), 2030 (2026-2040),
* 2050 (2041-2052). A record reads REG_BNDCST(region, year, cost type, currency, LO/FX/UP) and
* REG_CUMCST(region, first year, last year, cost type, currency, LO/FX/UP).
* New cost data (REG1 unless said):
* - investment taxes (NCAP_ITAX) on ELCTNCOA01, ELCTNOIL01, ELCNNNUC01 and, in REG2, ELCTNGAS01;
*   investment subsidies (NCAP_ISUB) on ELCRNWIN01 (both regions), ELCTNOIL01 and ELCNNNUC01.
* - ELCTNOIL01: a 10-year technical life, so its investments repeat in the periods 2030 and
*   2050 and its decommissioning falls inside the horizon; decommissioning cost, lifetime and
*   lag (NCAP_DCOST, NCAP_DLIFE, NCAP_DLAG), also on ELCNNNUC01.
* - taxes and subsidies on fixed costs (NCAP_FTAX, NCAP_FSUB), with shapes over the age and
*   multipliers over the years (SHAPE, MULTI) for the fixed cost and the tax of ELCTNCOA01
*   (NCAP_FOMX, NCAP_FOMM, NCAP_FTAXX) and the subsidy of ELCRNWIN01 (NCAP_FSUBX, NCAP_FSUBM).
* - taxes and subsidies on commodities: the net production of ELCCO2 and RSDCO2 (COM_TAXNET,
*   COM_SUBNET) and the production of ELC (COM_TAXPRD, COM_SUBPRD).
* - taxes and subsidies on flows (FLO_TAX, FLO_SUB): the gas input of ELCTEGAS00 and ELCTNGAS01
*   (on ELCTNGAS01 a subsidy grows past the tax, so the net changes sign over the years), the
*   output of ELCTEGAS00 at the timeslice SD, the output of the wind plants, the gas link from
*   REG2 and the electricity link (exchange processes), and an auxiliary flow of the gas link
*   (IRE_FLOSUM: INDCO2 per unit of gas imported).
* The bounds of single periods (REG_BNDCST; eqbndcst.mod L42 copies them to REG_CUMCST with
* the first year equal to the last, and L51-76 gives the investment types of such a bound
* annual coefficients, CST_ANNC):
* - REG1 INV, UP in 2020 and 2030; REG1 INVTAX, UP in 2020; REG1 INVSUB, LO in 2030 (a lower
*   bound alone; L46-47 adds an upper bound of INF).
* - REG1 INVTAXSUB, UP in 2050: an aggregate; L44-45 gives its parts an upper bound of INF.
* - REG1 FOM and FOMTAX, UP in 2030; FOMSUB, UP in 2020; FOMALL, UP in 2010 with interpolation
*   and forward extrapolation (option 5): rows in every period from 2010.
* - REG1 COMTAX, UP in 2020; FLOTAX, UP in 2020; FLOSUB, UP in 2030.
* - REG2 INVSUB, UP with the value EPS in 2015: no subsidised investment in 2015.
* - REG2 COMSUB, UP in 2020; FIXALL, LO in 2030; COMTAX, UP in 2030.
* The bounds over a range of years (REG_CUMCST):
* - REG1 INV 2012-2034; INVTAX and INVSUB 2008-2025; FOM 2010-2030; FOMTAX 2006-2052 (LO);
*   FOMSUB 2016-2045; FLOTAX 2011-2033 and 2000-2012 (a first year before the horizon); FLOSUB
*   2021-2060 (FX, a fixed value; a last year after the horizon); COMSUB 2015-2050; COMTAX
*   2007-2018 and 2045-2100; ALLTAXSUB 2005-2060 (all eight tax and subsidy types).
* - REG2 FIX 2010-2030; ALLTAX 2005-2050; ALLSUB 2013-2040 (LO); INVALL 2020-2020 (the same
*   as a bound of the single period 2020); INV 2022-2024 (inside one period, no milestone year).
$ONEMPTY
$ONEPS
$ONWARNING
SET TOP /
REG1.TU_GAS_REG2_REG1_01.INDCO2.OUT
/

PARAMETER
IRE_FLOSUM ' '/
REG1.2005.TU_GAS_REG2_REG1_01.GAS.ANNUAL.IMP.INDCO2.OUT 0.01
/

PARAMETER
NCAP_TLIFE ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCTNOIL01 10
/

PARAMETER
NCAP_ITAX ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCTNCOA01.MEuro05 200
REG1.2005.ELCTNOIL01.MEuro05 60
REG1.2005.ELCNNNUC01.MEuro05 100
REG2.2006.ELCTNGAS01.MEuro05 50
/

PARAMETER
NCAP_ISUB ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCRNWIN01.MEuro05 300
REG1.2005.ELCTNOIL01.MEuro05 20
REG1.2005.ELCNNNUC01.MEuro05 40
REG2.2005.ELCRNWIN01.MEuro05 150
/

PARAMETER
NCAP_DCOST ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCTNOIL01.MEuro05 30
REG1.2005.ELCNNNUC01.MEuro05 400
/

PARAMETER
NCAP_DLIFE ' '/
